1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,253
JESUS: A new commandment I give you.

2
00:00:06,603 --> 00:00:08,465
JESUS: My command is this:

3
00:00:08,665 --> 00:00:12,044
JESUS: Love one another... as I have loved you.

4
00:00:12,994 --> 00:00:16,323
He said this on the night He was betrayed...

5
00:00:16,423 --> 00:00:22,019
only moments after handing bread to Judas, the man who would betray Him.

6
00:00:26,769 --> 00:00:30,996
Just as Judas betrayed Jesus... by getting Him killed,

7
00:00:31,046 --> 00:00:36,072
a man named Paul once betrayed Asher... by getting his father killed.

8
00:00:36,622 --> 00:00:41,866
Behind this door, that old man waits to die... for the name of Jesus.

9
00:00:42,116 --> 00:00:47,280
This man persecuted Jesus... by hunting down those who followed Him.

10
00:00:48,330 --> 00:00:51,488
The man standing outside is Asher.

11
00:00:51,538 --> 00:00:54,867
When he was a boy, Paul took his father from him...

12
00:00:54,917 --> 00:00:58,072
and Asher has hated him ever since.

13
00:00:58,522 --> 00:01:02,383
ASHER: Bread. I'm only bringing him bread. That should be enough for him.

14
00:01:02,933 --> 00:01:05,529
ASHER: You know what? I don't even want to be here.

15
00:01:05,879 --> 00:01:08,351
ASHER: Why am I even here? This is foolish.

16
00:01:10,501 --> 00:01:14,940
Months earlier, in a house where followers of Jesus gathered...

17
00:01:14,990 --> 00:01:18,655
a letter from the apostle Paul was read aloud.

18
00:01:18,905 --> 00:01:24,003
PHOEBE: This is Paul, a servant of Christ Jesus... to all in Rome who are loved by God.

19
00:01:25,053 --> 00:01:28,246
PHOEBE: For I tell you, do not repay anyone evil for evil.

20
00:01:28,496 --> 00:01:33,034
PHOEBE: If it is possible, as far as it depends on you... live at peace with everyone.

21
00:01:33,284 --> 00:01:38,281
PHOEBE: If your enemy is hungry, feed him. If he is thirsty, give him something to drink.

22
00:01:38,431 --> 00:01:41,674
PHOEBE: In doing this, you will heap burning coals on his head.

23
00:01:46,323 --> 00:01:47,624
ASHER: His own words.

24
00:01:48,274 --> 00:01:49,960
ASHER: Let's see if he believes them.

25
00:01:55,310 --> 00:01:57,204
GUARD: Food for the old man?

26
00:01:57,454 --> 00:02:00,609
GUARD: You're the first one in a week. Make it quick.

27
00:02:03,059 --> 00:02:05,602
PAUL: My brother Luke... is that you?

28
00:02:05,952 --> 00:02:08,856
PAUL: Come in, come in! Thank you for seeing me.

29
00:02:09,006 --> 00:02:14,924
PAUL: The Lord provides... He blesses us in ways we sometimes can't possibly imagine.

30
00:02:15,174 --> 00:02:18,672
PAUL: And you've brought bread. God bless you for doing that.

31
00:02:18,922 --> 00:02:22,688
PAUL: So many are afraid to come now. I don't blame them.

32
00:02:22,838 --> 00:02:24,267
PAUL: But you came.

33
00:02:25,517 --> 00:02:36,002
ASHER: Look, Paul... I need you to know that I am not Luke, and I really don't know who that guy is, unfortunately. He sounds like a good guy, though... so thank you.

34
00:02:36,452 --> 00:02:39,238
ASHER: For thinking I could be someone so dear to you.

35
00:02:39,888 --> 00:02:42,093
PAUL: Then who are you, my friend?

36
00:02:42,643 --> 00:02:46,838
ASHER: Someone you met once... in Jerusalem. A long time ago.

37
00:02:47,088 --> 00:02:50,333
ASHER: The street of the potters. A house with a blue door.

38
00:02:50,683 --> 00:02:53,629
ASHER: You came at night... with the temple guard.

39
00:02:54,279 --> 00:02:57,818
ASHER: You dragged a man named Yosef, my father, into the street.

40
00:02:57,968 --> 00:02:59,384
ASHER: In front of his wife.

41
00:02:59,434 --> 00:03:00,849
ASHER: In front of his son.

42
00:03:01,599 --> 00:03:03,124
PAUL: Yosef...

43
00:03:03,974 --> 00:03:08,505
ASHER: I was eight years old. I watched it all... through a crack in the door.

44
00:03:09,155 --> 00:03:11,238
ASHER: My father never came home.

45
00:03:14,189 --> 00:03:15,797
PAUL: He looked at me.

46
00:03:16,347 --> 00:03:19,695
PAUL: When we bound his hands... he looked straight at me.

47
00:03:19,945 --> 00:03:22,886
PAUL: Not with hatred. I knew hatred.

48
00:03:23,236 --> 00:03:27,888
PAUL: He looked at me like he was sorry about what I was doing to him...

49
00:03:27,938 --> 00:03:33,922
PAUL: like he disagreed with my actions, but refused to use violence to stop me.

50
00:03:37,772 --> 00:03:39,415
YOUNG ASHER: Father! Don't go!

51
00:03:40,965 --> 00:03:44,482
YOSEF: Asher, my son... don't be afraid for me.

52
00:03:44,732 --> 00:03:48,858
YOSEF: I am in the hands of God. He will keep me safe...

53
00:03:48,908 --> 00:03:53,907
YOSEF: and He who blesses us all will keep you safe, forever and ever.

54
00:03:54,057 --> 00:03:59,343
YOSEF: Keep me in your heart, my son... while I will keep you in my mind.

55
00:04:01,493 --> 00:04:02,448
PAUL: Take him!

56
00:04:04,999 --> 00:04:09,010
YOSEF: May God be the light that opens your eyes someday, Paul.

57
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:12,727
PAUL: Guards, take him away.

58
00:04:21,177 --> 00:04:22,037
ASHER: Don't.

59
00:04:22,287 --> 00:04:24,010
ASHER: You don't get to remember him.

60
00:04:24,460 --> 00:04:27,124
PAUL: I remember him because I must.

61
00:04:27,374 --> 00:04:32,461
PAUL: Every soul I wounded is a soul Jesus Christ came to save...

62
00:04:32,511 --> 00:04:35,768
PAUL: your father... and you... and even me.

63
00:04:36,118 --> 00:04:40,866
PAUL: I will spend every breath I have left proclaiming His mercy on me...

64
00:04:40,916 --> 00:04:47,299
PAUL: until it reaches all of them. Even the ones lost to me... or even to the Father.

65
00:04:49,049 --> 00:04:51,051
ASHER: They read your letter to us in Rome.

66
00:04:51,301 --> 00:04:53,957
ASHER: “If your enemy is hungry, feed him.”

67
00:04:54,307 --> 00:04:55,844
ASHER: So. I'm feeding you.

68
00:04:57,994 --> 00:05:01,125
PAUL: Then you have done what I only wrote about.

69
00:05:01,375 --> 00:05:07,223
PAUL: You are fulfilling the word of the Son of Man... by helping one of His sheep, like me.

70
00:05:07,573 --> 00:05:11,738
ASHER: Can you spare me having to take part in your whole mercy thing, please?

71
00:05:11,788 --> 00:05:13,338
ASHER: Don't make me your saint.

72
00:05:13,588 --> 00:05:15,320
ASHER: You act like a saint now...

73
00:05:15,340 --> 00:05:19,876
ASHER: but you weren't acting like a saint when you destroyed me and my father's life.

74
00:05:20,126 --> 00:05:22,600
ASHER: Do your followers even know what you did?

75
00:05:23,050 --> 00:05:24,153
PAUL: They know.

76
00:05:24,303 --> 00:05:28,759
PAUL: I put it in my letters, so that no one forgets what I did.

77
00:05:29,109 --> 00:05:35,927
PAUL: I was a blasphemer... and a persecutor... and a violent man towards many people.

78
00:05:36,477 --> 00:05:39,079
PAUL: I thought I was defending God.

79
00:05:39,429 --> 00:05:41,720
PAUL: But I was hunting His sheep.

80
00:05:42,870 --> 00:05:48,000
PAUL: I carried the pain of what I did with me... all the way to Damascus.

81
00:05:48,250 --> 00:05:51,032
PAUL: I had orders to arrest more people.

82
00:05:54,982 --> 00:05:58,465
JESUS: Why must my sheep be persecuted by you, Paul?

83
00:05:58,915 --> 00:06:01,588
PAUL: Who is this? Is this the Lord?

84
00:06:02,138 --> 00:06:06,987
JESUS: I am Jesus. I came to save those who are not yet saved.

85
00:06:07,937 --> 00:06:10,288
JESUS: You are precious to me, Paul.

86
00:06:10,438 --> 00:06:16,514
JESUS: Open your heart to me... and carry the Holy Spirit, with me and my Father.

87
00:06:17,064 --> 00:06:20,706
PAUL: I had a sense that my destruction was deserved...

88
00:06:20,956 --> 00:06:24,840
PAUL: and yet He looked at me... the same way Yosef had.

89
00:06:25,290 --> 00:06:31,049
PAUL: I was shown mercy, because in part I acted in ignorance and unbelief.

90
00:06:31,199 --> 00:06:35,184
PAUL: The grace of our Lord was poured out on me abundantly...

91
00:06:35,204 --> 00:06:39,585
PAUL: along with the faith and love that are in Christ Jesus.

92
00:06:39,935 --> 00:06:44,225
PAUL: I thank Christ Jesus our Lord, who has given me strength...

93
00:06:44,275 --> 00:06:48,794
PAUL: that He considered me trustworthy, appointing me to His service.

94
00:06:49,144 --> 00:06:54,558
PAUL: He chose me... the very one who hunted those in partnership with Him.

95
00:06:55,308 --> 00:06:56,483
ASHER: So that's it?

96
00:06:56,733 --> 00:06:59,618
ASHER: You saw a light... and all your sin washed away?

97
00:06:59,968 --> 00:07:06,313
ASHER: And taking my father out of my life was just... a stepping stone on your path to enlightenment?

98
00:07:06,963 --> 00:07:11,471
PAUL: Nothing washes away the memory of your father. Not for me.

99
00:07:11,821 --> 00:07:16,394
PAUL: I see his face every time I write the word “mercy.”

100
00:07:17,644 --> 00:07:22,254
PAUL: Here is a trustworthy saying that deserves full acceptance:

101
00:07:22,404 --> 00:07:26,292
PAUL: Christ Jesus came into the world to save sinners...

102
00:07:26,542 --> 00:07:29,516
PAUL: of whom I am among the worst.

103
00:07:30,166 --> 00:07:33,506
PAUL: But for that very reason, I was shown mercy...

104
00:07:33,556 --> 00:07:37,960
PAUL: by Him, the Lord... the One who saved me from myself...

105
00:07:38,110 --> 00:07:44,823
PAUL: so that in me, the worst of sinners, Christ Jesus might display His immense patience with me...

106
00:07:44,873 --> 00:07:50,459
PAUL: as an example for those who would believe in Him... and receive eternal life.

107
00:07:51,209 --> 00:07:52,849
ASHER: I came here to hate you.

108
00:07:53,399 --> 00:07:55,425
ASHER: I rehearsed it. For years.

109
00:07:55,774 --> 00:07:58,050
ASHER: You say all these beautiful things...

110
00:07:58,200 --> 00:08:02,590
ASHER: but I don't think I will ever love you... like you seem to want me to.

111
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,890
PAUL: I understand.

112
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:08,315
PAUL: And there is no hate in my heart for that.

113
00:08:08,565 --> 00:08:12,276
PAUL: And I will respect your boundary to not love me.

114
00:08:12,425 --> 00:08:22,152
PAUL: And love, from what I understand... from what I've learned about God... is only something that can be grown... never forced, or coerced...

115
00:08:22,202 --> 00:08:28,798
PAUL: that is a power even God does not have, as far as I'm aware... blessed be His name.

116
00:08:29,148 --> 00:08:35,861
PAUL: Even the hate you have given me is from what God has given you in your life... even the worst of it.

117
00:08:35,910 --> 00:08:40,574
PAUL: And that is something I'm atoning for right now... hopefully with you.

118
00:08:41,124 --> 00:08:45,393
PAUL: The prayers I pray will be not just for you, but for the world...

119
00:08:45,443 --> 00:08:49,302
PAUL: in His mighty name, all the time that I have left.

120
00:08:49,552 --> 00:08:55,501
PAUL: And I will see you as a brother, within my heart and soul... if you will allow it.

121
00:08:56,051 --> 00:08:57,011
ASHER: Look...

122
00:08:57,661 --> 00:08:59,602
ASHER: I am not your brother, okay?

123
00:09:00,252 --> 00:09:04,910
PAUL: That's correct. No one can be your brother except your brother...

124
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:08,502
PAUL: and it appears that I am no brother to you.

125
00:09:10,452 --> 00:09:15,199
PAUL: I tell you, the Lord has been patient with me. He sat with me.

126
00:09:15,749 --> 00:09:16,908
ASHER: And still...

127
00:09:17,258 --> 00:09:18,644
ASHER: I brought the bread.

128
00:09:19,394 --> 00:09:26,223
JESUS: Asher, here is a new commandment I give you: love one another, as I have loved you.

129
00:09:33,173 --> 00:09:35,148
ASHER: I don't forgive you. Not yet.

130
00:09:35,698 --> 00:09:38,401
ASHER: But my father would have shared his bread with you...

131
00:09:38,551 --> 00:09:39,777
ASHER: so I will.

132
00:09:42,827 --> 00:09:45,727
PAUL: Burning coals... on my head.

133
00:09:46,277 --> 00:09:48,263
PAUL: I wrote those words...

134
00:09:48,413 --> 00:09:54,005
PAUL: I never knew how much the love of Christ would burn me... but for the better.

135
00:09:54,755 --> 00:09:57,459
Do not be overcome by evil...

136
00:09:57,709 --> 00:10:00,382
but overcome evil with good.

137
00:10:02,332 --> 00:10:03,589
GUARD: Time's up.

138
00:10:03,939 --> 00:10:07,973
GUARD: And you, old man... your execution is tomorrow. At first light.

139
00:10:08,923 --> 00:10:10,002
ASHER: Tomorrow?

140
00:10:10,452 --> 00:10:12,079
PAUL: I understand.

141
00:10:12,329 --> 00:10:13,974
GUARD: Say your goodbyes.

142
00:10:14,924 --> 00:10:16,227
ASHER: Aren't you afraid?

143
00:10:17,177 --> 00:10:19,448
PAUL: The Lord provides, Asher.

144
00:10:19,798 --> 00:10:23,093
PAUL: Who shall separate us from the love of Christ?

145
00:10:23,343 --> 00:10:26,842
PAUL: Shall trouble, or hardship, or persecution...

146
00:10:26,862 --> 00:10:30,696
PAUL: or famine, or nakedness, or danger, or sword?

147
00:10:30,946 --> 00:10:35,322
PAUL: As it is written: “For your sake we face death all day long;

148
00:10:35,342 --> 00:10:38,607
PAUL: we are considered as sheep to be slaughtered.”

149
00:10:38,957 --> 00:10:44,417
PAUL: No! I say to you, in all these things we are more than simple conquerors...

150
00:10:44,437 --> 00:10:46,817
PAUL: through Him who loved us.

151
00:10:47,167 --> 00:10:50,606
PAUL: For I am convinced that neither death nor life,

152
00:10:50,626 --> 00:10:56,376
PAUL: neither angels nor demons, neither the present nor the future, nor any powers,

153
00:10:56,396 --> 00:11:00,844
PAUL: neither height nor depth, nor anything else in all creation...

154
00:11:00,894 --> 00:11:05,671
PAUL: will be able to separate us from the love of the Lord our God...

155
00:11:05,691 --> 00:11:15,987
PAUL: from Christ Jesus, who saved me from causing more harm... the One sent from heaven to save us from what the Lord has not taught us yet.

156
00:11:16,537 --> 00:11:17,684
ASHER: Thank you.

157
00:11:19,634 --> 00:11:23,245
At first light, the old man Paul was no more.

158
00:11:23,895 --> 00:11:30,876
Among the few people who were present with him to the end... was the one who had every reason to hate him.

159
00:11:32,826 --> 00:11:35,737
ASHER: Lord... I don't know how to love him yet.

160
00:11:36,187 --> 00:11:37,424
ASHER: Teach me.

161
00:11:39,574 --> 00:11:44,156
JESUS: Learn from me... for I am gentle and humble in heart.

162
00:11:44,506 --> 00:11:50,176
JESUS: And the more you learn about me... the more you might learn how to love another.

163
00:11:52,926 --> 00:11:55,452
JESUS: A new commandment I give you.

164
00:11:55,802 --> 00:11:57,810
JESUS: My command is this:

165
00:11:58,060 --> 00:12:01,610
JESUS: love one another... as I have loved you.

